  "description": {
    "zh": "真实雨天玻璃窗：有机重力形变雨滴、凸透镜倒像折射、三通道色散与粘滑下落水痕；大雨滴、小雨滴与长条雨滴分别可调密度、大小、相位与置换强度，水流经过会自然擦净雾气并融合小水珠。",
    "en": "Realistic rain on window glass: gravity-deformed organic drops, convex-lens inverted refraction, 3-channel dispersion and stick-slip falling streaks. Large drops, small drops and streaks each have independent density, size, phase and displacement controls, wiping fog and absorbing small droplets along their path."
  },
